{"id":"b6421ddd1ab65a55","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/05_lambda.md","title":"指标 λ、替换和操作语义","display":"指标 λ、替换和操作语义","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","specification"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>specification</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"1.-有限代码与作用域\">1. 有限代码与作用域</h2>\n<p>URaw 只含 v、无注解 lam、app。AnyRaw 是还允许常项和任意集合注解的辅助谓词；<strong>没有声称所有 AnyRaw 是一个集合</strong>。Scoped(d,t) 逐绑定增加 d 并要求所有变量指标小于深度。0 表示最近的外层绑定。类型系统再施加各自的有限类型/常项集合条件。</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>集合参数（按位置）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fad087c9d77463a6\" href=\"?note=fad087c9d77463a6\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_URaw\">URaw</a></td>\n<td><code>t</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"487e9a7343d4d692\" href=\"?note=487e9a7343d4d692\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_AnyRaw\">AnyRaw</a></td>\n<td><code>t</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c005a1be0b2ad21f\" href=\"?note=c005a1be0b2ad21f\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_Scoped\">Scoped</a></td>\n<td><code>d, t</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0ddb51851d7f428a\" href=\"?note=0ddb51851d7f428a\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LShift\">LShift</a></td>\n<td><code>c, d, t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0022091441242a73\" href=\"?note=0022091441242a73\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LInst\">LInst</a></td>\n<td><code>c, s, t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"872d69ad4914c61a\" href=\"?note=872d69ad4914c61a\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LOcc\">LOcc</a></td>\n<td><code>c, t</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8f1c3bf32b9b2a43\" href=\"?note=8f1c3bf32b9b2a43\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LDown\">LDown</a></td>\n<td><code>c, t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>LShift(c,k) 将指标 ≥c 加 k，进入 λ 时 c 增一。LInst(c,s) 删除一个绑定：小于 c 不变，等于 c 用 shift(0,c,s) 取代，大于 c 减一。它与不删除绑定的替换不是同一操作。LDown 在 c 不出现时才定义；η 不能省略这个前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2.-一步、有限转换与无限运行\">2. 一步、有限转换与无限运行</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>集合参数（按位置）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5486b4711e36aa74\" href=\"?note=5486b4711e36aa74\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LStepAlpha\">LStepAlpha</a></td>\n<td><code>t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"67ac070138945217\" href=\"?note=67ac070138945217\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LConvertAlpha\">LConvertAlpha</a></td>\n<td><code>d, t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3febe648f9fc21a8\" href=\"?note=3febe648f9fc21a8\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LStepBeta\">LStepBeta</a></td>\n<td><code>t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"6f63f9693c73975a\" href=\"?note=6f63f9693c73975a\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LStepBetaEta\">LStepBetaEta</a></td>\n<td><code>t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"caf309d20e74ff8d\" href=\"?note=caf309d20e74ff8d\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LStepCBN\">LStepCBN</a></td>\n<td><code>t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"4969a7520165a3ee\" href=\"?note=4969a7520165a3ee\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LStepCBV\">LStepCBV</a></td>\n<td><code>t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"f75c321d9cdbb404\" href=\"?note=f75c321d9cdbb404\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LReachBeta\">LReachBeta</a></td>\n<td><code>d, t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"84b716fe2026377e\" href=\"?note=84b716fe2026377e\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LConvertBeta\">LConvertBeta</a></td>\n<td><code>d, t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"f630ca741681d9ce\" href=\"?note=f630ca741681d9ce\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LEvalCBN\">LEvalCBN</a></td>\n<td><code>t, v</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"32a4962f5a4c639d\" href=\"?note=32a4962f5a4c639d\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LEvalCBV\">LEvalCBV</a></td>\n<td><code>d, t, v</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"ddd98a388acc4881\" href=\"?note=ddd98a388acc4881\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LDivergesCBN\">LDivergesCBN</a></td>\n<td><code>d, t</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"0daa1a53b80c703c\" href=\"?note=0daa1a53b80c703c\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LDivergesCBV\">LDivergesCBV</a></td>\n<td><code>d, t</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>完全 β 允许进入 λ 体和应用两侧；完全 βη 另有 η。CBN 仅根 β 与应用左侧。CBV 根 β 要求实参为值，应用右侧要求左项为值；开放值包括变量。CBN 主 Eval 限闭项并以 λ 为值。Reach 只允许正向边；Convert 允许两方向；有限列可有相等相邻项。Diverges 的无限列每步必须是真正规约边，不能用相等补齐。</p>\n<p>303 的一步关系为空，α 商上的无前提转换是相等。这不代替其开放等式理论；303–305 的主要 Γ 接口在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"164f10d6a348b7a4\" href=\"?note=164f10d6a348b7a4\" title=\"10_named_equations\">10_named_equations</a>。</p>\n<p>未声明任意项都终止、β 可转换性均可判定或标准化定理已核验。证明证书的有限检查不是这些判定问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-有限代码与作用域","text":"1. 有限代码与作用域","level":2},{"id":"2.-一步、有限转换与无限运行","text":"2. 一步、有限转换与无限运行","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_URaw","status":"resolved","id":"fad087c9d77463a6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 有限代码与作用域","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_URaw|URaw]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_AnyRaw","status":"resolved","id":"487e9a7343d4d692","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 有限代码与作用域","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_AnyRaw|AnyRaw]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_Scoped","status":"resolved","id":"c005a1be0b2ad21f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 有限代码与作用域","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_Scoped|Scoped]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LShift","status":"resolved","id":"0ddb51851d7f428a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 有限代码与作用域","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LShift|LShift]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LInst","status":"resolved","id":"0022091441242a73","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 有限代码与作用域","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LInst|LInst]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LOcc","status":"resolved","id":"872d69ad4914c61a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 有限代码与作用域","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LOcc|LOcc]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LDown","status":"resolved","id":"8f1c3bf32b9b2a43","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 有限代码与作用域","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LDown|LDown]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LStepAlpha","status":"resolved","id":"5486b4711e36aa74","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 一步、有限转换与无限运行","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LStepAlpha|LStepAlpha]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LConvertAlpha","status":"resolved","id":"67ac070138945217","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 一步、有限转换与无限运行","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LConvertAlpha|LConvertAlpha]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LStepBeta","status":"resolved","id":"3febe648f9fc21a8","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 一步、有限转换与无限运行","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LStepBeta|LStepBeta]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LStepBetaEta","status":"resolved","id":"6f63f9693c73975a","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 一步、有限转换与无限运行","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LStepBetaEta|LStepBetaEta]]","embed":false},{"target