步、有限转换与无限运行","excerpt":"303 的一步关系为空，α 商上的无前提转换是相等。这不代替其开放等式理论；303–305 的主要 Γ 接口在 [[10_named_equations]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":2751,"backlinks":[{"id":"2a802213915eee42","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[05_lambda]]"},{"id":"c76920a4aa016144","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"各参数的意义、构造子及局部条款见 [[000_ZFC/05_lambda]]。纯语言约定见 [[000_ZFC/01_language]]，有限证明列的读法见 [[000_ZFC/02_proofs]]。"},{"id":"9a2945bc56d78cc0","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"各参数的意义、构造子及局部条款见 [[000_ZFC/05_lambda]]。纯语言约定见 [[000_ZFC/01_language]]，有限证明列的读法见 [[000_ZFC/02_proofs]]。"}],"outgoing":["fad087c9d77463a6","487e9a7343d4d692","c005a1be0b2ad21f","0ddb51851d7f428a","0022091441242a73","872d69ad4914c61a","8f1c3bf32b9b2a43","5486b4711e36aa74","67ac070138945217","3febe648f9fc21a8","6f63f9693c73975a","caf309d20e74ff8d","4969a7520165a3ee","f75c321d9cdbb404","84b716fe2026377e","f630ca741681d9ce","32a4962f5a4c639d","ddd98a388acc4881","0daa1a53b80c703c","164f10d6a348b7a4"]}